    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Positioned in the heart of the ever-popular coastal village of Kinvara, 3 Castleview Park is a spacious four-bedroom detached bungalow offering an exceptional opportunity to acquire a family home in one of South Galway's most sought-after locations. Enjoying spectacular views across Kinvara Bay towards the iconic Dunguaire Castle, the property combines generous living accommodation with a superb setting. Internally, the accommodation comprises a welcoming sitting room, separate living room, kitchen, utility room, study, four well-proportioned bedrooms (including a master with en-suite), and a family bathroom, providing ample space for modern family living.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous site with a large private garden, this wonderful home is ideally located within a short stroll of Kinvara's excellent range of amenities, including cafés, restaurants, shops, schools, the picturesque Quay and scenic waterfront walks. Whether you are seeking a permanent family residence, a retirement home or a property in one of the Wild Atlantic Way's most desirable villages, 3 Castleview Park offers an enviable combination of location, space and breathtaking sea views that are rarely available.\r\n\r\nKinvara is recognised as one of the most sought-after locations on the West coast, which is famous for traditional Irish music and culture and hosts the famous Fleadh na gCuach and the Cruinniu na mBad festivals annually. Kinvara has excellent transport links with the M18 and the M6 easily accessed at nearby Ardrahan as is the railway station and there is daily Bus Eireann service bringing Galway, Limerick, Ennis and Loughrea all within easy reach. It is a village that has everything: great natural beauty and amenities, great facilities and services and a warm friendly population.\r\n\r\nSERVICES: Mains \r\nHEATING SYSTEM: O.F.C.H\r\nPROPERTY SIZE: 125m²\r\nPROPERTY AGE: 1980\r\nBUILDING ENERGY RATING: C 119622124 196.54 kWh/m²/yr 44.37 kgCO2 /m²/yr Exp: \r\n13/07/2036"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "HALLWAY - 6.8m x 1.4 & 5.6 x 1m\r\nCarpeted Flooring\r\n\r\nSITTING ROOM - 4.7m x 4.6m\r\nCarpeted flooring, Feature fireplace with open fire, Wall Sconces, Dual aspect windows, French doors to living room\r\n\r\nKITCHEN - 3.8m x 3.5m\r\nWooden/Tiled flooring, White fitted kitchen, Tiled splashback, Recessed lights\r\n\r\nUTILITY - 3m x 1.4m\r\nTiled flooring, Fitted Cupboard, Plumbed for washer/dryer, Back door\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM - 3.7m x 3.3m\r\nWooden flooring, Oil Stove\r\n\r\nSTUDY - 3.5m x 2.6m\r\nCarpeted flooring, Fitted Shelving/cupboards\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1 - 3.7m x 3.4m\r\nCarpeted flooring, Fitted Wardrobes\r\n\r\nENSUITE - 2m 1.8m\r\nTiled floor to ceiling, W.C, W.H.B with vanity, Shower\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2 - 3.6m x 3m\r\nCarpeted flooring, Fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3 - 3.7m x 3m\r\nCarpeted flooring, Fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 4 - 3.2m x 2.2m\r\nCarpeted flooring, Fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nFAMILY BATHROOM - 1.8m x 2.4m\r\nTiled floor to ceiling, W.C, W.H.B with vanity, Bath with shower over"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Fantastic 4 bedroom (one ensuite) detached Bungalow</li><li> Located in the Heart of Kinvara Village</li><li> Amazing Views of Kinvara Bay & Dunguaire Castle</li><li> Walking Distance to all amenities</li><li> Large Garden</li><li> South facing rear garden</li></ul>"
